      "cooked": "<p>Refer to previous discussion here. http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/forum/topic/chairmanoperative-question</p><p>We encountered this problem again and it wasn't definitively answered in the previous thread.</p><p>Official ruling says that Chairman (and I presume can be extended to all other villian characters such as Omnitron) can go under Savage Mana.</p><p>Question is, can other targets with an Incapacitated side go under Savage Mana? I.e. Hero characters, Operative, Ennead.</p><p>If so, there exists player elimination? Because the incapacitated hero that went under Savage Mana can't use his incapacitated powers anymore.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:34.860Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
