      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-02T04:08:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think the crux comes form the idea that cards only go under Savage Mana when they are destroyed. &nbsp;Cards with incapacitated sides flip to their other side \"when they would be destroyed\", thus meaning they are not, in fact, destroyed.</p>",
