    {
      "id": 42408,
      "name": "Greonhal",
      "username": "Greonhal",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/bb73d2/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-02T17:32:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Most other character cards are destroyed, like The Chairman, it's just that he's the only one who can be destroyed and have the game not end. If, for instance, Spite is dropped to 0 HP, he's destroyed and the game is over. Since the game is over, Haka doesn't stuff him under Savage Mana to save up for the next fight. The only other villains that can be defeated without the game immediately ending specify other things. The Operative and the Ennead are incapacitated, rather than destroyed, and Omnitron specifies that he is removed from play.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:16:02.467Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
